  "_about": "a golden eagle soaring: wings spread flat in a shallow V -- a broad arm of secondaries under their coverts, the hand's seven slotted primaries spread like fingers -- the tail fanned; a deep chest, the head with its flat crown, the brow over the eye, the golden nape and the hooked beak with its yellow cere; feathered legs drawn up under the tail, the yellow toes and black talons closed (2026-11-08, review.py: claws) The claws RE-ROOTED (review.py): each a sheath as wide as the claw where it leaves the toe, sunk in it, the join faired (horn `fair`: grown out of the skin in its paint), darker at the base fading to its own colour at the point -- no pale cut edge where it leaves the fur.",
